- How would you model slow network partitions and database failures?
- What metrics would you monitor to detect flag propagation lag?
- How would you validate flag consistency across a multi-region deployment?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests for event-driven flows are common in production; beginners should grasp end-to-end testing, idempotency, and failure handling.

## Key Concepts

- End-to-end testing of queues and email sinks
- Idempotent processing of events
